section.collection-hero
  .wrap.collection-hero-grid
    .collection-intro
      p.section-kicker.on-dark Comics
      h1 Read Kamigen
      p The whole story, from the official cover through the latest pages. Start at the beginning or choose an issue.
      .actions
        a.btn.btn-primary(href='/comics/cover.html') Read the whole story
        a.btn.btn-secondary(href='/comics/page_129.html') Latest release
    a.collection-cover(href='/comics/cover.html')
      img(src='/art/comics/SD/Kamigen_Cover.png' alt='Kamigen collected comic cover')

section.issues.collection-page(aria-labelledby='collection-title')
  .wrap
    .section-head
      div
        p.section-kicker Reading order
        h2#collection-title The collection
        p.deck Five issues and 133 pages. Covers keep their original proportions.
    .issue-grid
      article.issue
        .issue-num(aria-hidden='true') 01
        a.issue-art(href='/comics/issue_1.html')
          img(src='/art/comics/SD/Kamigen%20Issue%2001%20Cover-01.png' alt='Issue 01 cover')
        .issue-body
          h3 Welcome to Kamigen
          p The first issue introduces Kamigen Island and explains a bit about the current state of the world.
          a.btn.btn-ink(href='/comics/issue_1.html') Open Issue 01
          a.issue-extra(href='/comics/issue_1_script.html') Read transcript
      article.issue
        .issue-num(aria-hidden='true') 02
        a.issue-art(href='/comics/issue_2.html')
          img(src='/art/comics/SD/Kamigen%20Issue%2002%20Cover-01.png' alt='Issue 02 cover')
        .issue-body
          h3 Mysteries in Outer Space
          p Ryoko is part of a team tasked with saving the Earth from a second water comet and the human race from extinction!
          a.btn.btn-ink(href='/comics/issue_2.html') Open Issue 02
          a.issue-extra(href='/comics/issue_2_script.html') Read transcript
      article.issue
        .issue-num(aria-hidden='true') 03
        a.issue-art(href='/comics/issue_3.html')
          img(src='/art/comics/SD/Kamigen%20Issue%2003%20Cover-01.png' alt='Issue 03 cover')
        .issue-body
          h3 Bulawan
          p A hundred million years ago, an advanced society prospered from advancements based on ancient relics from a long dead race.
          a.btn.btn-ink(href='/comics/issue_3.html') Open Issue 03
      article.issue
        .issue-num(aria-hidden='true') 04
        a.issue-art(href='/comics/issue_4.html')
          img(src='/art/comics/SD/Kamigen%20Issue%2004%20Cover-01.png' alt='Issue 04 cover')
        .issue-body
          h3 Islands
          p Anak is on a quest to find out why he's the last of his kind - oh and he might as well save the human race along the way!
          a.btn.btn-ink(href='/comics/issue_4.html') Open Issue 04
      article.issue
        .issue-num(aria-hidden='true')
          | 05
          small In color
        a.issue-art(href='/comics/issue_5.html')
          img(src='/art/comics/SD/Kamigen%20Issue%2005%20Cover-01.png' alt='Issue 05 cover')
        .issue-body
          h3 Issue 05
          p This is the end of phase 1 and the first comic to be entirely in color!
          a.btn.btn-ink(href='/comics/issue_5.html') Open Issue 05
